  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Add Topic Information to NACK_FRAG submessage",
  "description": "NACK_FRAG was the only submessage with reader/writer entity IDs that\ndid not look up and display \"[Topic Information (from Discovery)]\".\nPropagate the endpoint GUID and call rtps_util_add_topic_info after\nparsing the writerEntityId, matching the existing HEARTBEAT_FRAG\npattern.\n\nThe fix adds guid->fields_present |= GUID_HAS_ENTITY_ID before the\nrtps_util_add_topic_info call — without this flag the registry lookup\nin rtps_util_get_topic_info always returned NULL.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
  "state": "merged",
